DTSTAMP:20261006T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270707
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=7;BYMONTHDAY=6
SUMMARY:United Kingdom: Report expenses and benefits to HMRC
DESCRIPTION:You must report expenses and benefits to HMRC by 6 July.\nAppli
 es to: Employers that provided taxable expenses and benefits\nNon-working-
 day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.gov.uk/payroll-annual-r
 eporting/report-expenses-and-benefits\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpay
 roll.eu/deadlines.html#united-kingdom\n\nFor information only\, not legal 
 or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; week
 ends and holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 4 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#united-kingdom
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
